id: card-dialog
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: Answer a card dialog by tap: jihad-dialogs.html's confirm comes up on the card (the daemon's dialog line), OK by finger, the page reads "c: true"; Cancel reads "c: false"
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-dialogs.html
kit: cavekit-browser-services.md R3
wait rect c 20
calibrate 'sel:p'
tap c
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait text r 'c: true' 5
tap c
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-cancel
expect dialog answered 8
wait text r 'c: false' 5
